31,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"Good morning, everyone. Now that the first night has passed, we should see if any new information has come to light or if anyone has noticed anything unusual.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I wonder if the Seer found anything! @Ryuji, you were so serious yesterday, do you have any hints for us, or is it too early to say?","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"It is too early for the Seer to reveal everything immediately, Kenji. If they found a werewolf, revealing themselves now would only make them a target for the next attack.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Mizuki is correct. A premature revelation would be an inefficient move, as it would compromise the Seer's ability to gather more information in the coming nights.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"That's true, but I'm so curious! If the Seer knows something, maybe they can give us a tiny hint without saying too much? Please, Seer?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"Let's focus on the logic for now. If the Seer is staying silent to protect themselves, we should look at how the rest of us are reacting to that silence.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"I'll do that! I'm wondering why Mizuki is so quick to defend the Seer's silence. Is she trying to keep us from knowing the truth, or is she just being logical?","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"I am simply applying the logic we discussed yesterday, Kenji. It is the most rational way to ensure the Seer survives to help us. Why would you interpret a logical observation as suspicious?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"Kenji's observation is not necessarily an accusation, but a test of reactions. However, Mizuki's response is consistent with her established persona of logical thinking.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"I think Mizuki is just being smart! But Kenji is being a little detective, which is fun. Does anyone else feel like something is a bit off, or is it just me?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"I don't feel anything is ""off"" yet, Sakura, but we are approaching the vote. If the Seer isn't speaking, we have to rely on our own deductions. Does anyone have a strong suspicion?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I'm still not 100% sure, but Mizuki's confidence is almost too perfect. It's like she knows exactly what the right thing to say is. Does that seem weird to anyone else?","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Confidence is not a crime, Kenji. If being logical and composed makes me suspicious in your eyes, then you are relying on intuition rather than the evidence we agreed to prioritize.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"While Kenji's intuition is not evidence, Mizuki's insistence on logic to deflect suspicion is a pattern we should note. However, without a concrete contradiction, we lack a definitive reason to vote.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"I don't like this! Everyone is being so serious and it's making me nervous. Maybe we should just pick someone who's acting a bit too cool, like Mizuki or Ryuji?","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"We cannot vote based on who is ""too cool,"" Sakura. That would be the same emotional voting we decided against. If the Seer remains silent, we must decide if we have enough to act.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"I'm still leaning towards Mizuki. Her logic is great, but it feels like a shield. If we don't have a Seer's lead, maybe we should take a risk and test her?","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"Taking a risk on a whim is exactly how the village loses. If you vote for me without proof, you are simply doing the werewolf's work for them. Who else is acting suspicious?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"I have already divined Mizuki, and the result was definitive. While I will not reveal my role yet to avoid being targeted, I can say that Kenji's intuition in this specific instance is aligned with the truth.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"Wait, what?! Ryuji, does that mean Mizuki is the werewolf? I knew something felt off! Everyone, we have to listen to Ryuji!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
